# Template for the /dbadmin basic-auth file. NOT used directly.
#
# 1. Generate a real entry on any machine with docker:
#      docker run --rm httpd:2.4-alpine htpasswd -nbB founding-director
#    It prints:  founding-director:$2y$05$....  (it prompts for the password)
# 2. Save that single line as:  gateway/.htpasswd
# 3. gateway/.htpasswd is git-ignored and mounted read-only into nginx.
#
# Example line shape (DO NOT USE — replace with generated output):
# founding-director:$2y$05$REPLACE_WITH_GENERATED_HASH
